{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Swarm at Sea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight to the open ocean in this fast-paced top-down roguelite shooter where you pilot everything from a humble raft to a full-blown battleship. Battle relentless hordes of mutant sea creatures, upgrade your firepower, and see how long you can stay afloat in this nautical twist on the auto-shooter genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your ship. Pick your weapon. Aim. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D top-down arena shooter, you\u2019ll start each run by selecting your vessel and a primary weapon, which you manually aim with the mouse. As the ocean gets deadlier by the second, you\u2019ll gather upgrades, unlock new ship weapons that auto-fire at nearby threats, and build an unstoppable floating fortress, or sink trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759610/extras/1405e669528b09f291dc5c5c7369288a.poster.avif?t=1764072882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759610/extras/1405e669528b09f291dc5c5c7369288a.webm?t=1764072882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759610/extras/1405e669528b09f291dc5c5c7369288a.mp4?t=1764072882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle waves of aggressive sea creatures in real-time combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and pilot unique ships, from makeshift rafts to war-ready battleships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually aim your starter weapon for precision, while new weapons auto-fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your arsenal and combine weapons for devastating synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression: No two runs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against elite enemies and monstrous bosses from the deep</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759610?t=1764072882","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759610/088e84ea34cc8b8de6f240feed569128ad646a09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764072882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759610/ba33f583a3e7dc0fe1ee7403e32fd2bc125ceffe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764072882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759610/ba33f583a3e7dc0fe1ee7403e32fd2bc125ceffe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764072882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Swarm at Sea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight to the open ocean in this fast-paced top-down roguelite shooter where you pilot everything from a humble raft to a full-blown battleship. Battle relentless hordes of mutant sea creatures, upgrade your firepower, and see how long you can stay afloat in this nautical twist on the auto-shooter genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your ship. Pick your weapon. Aim. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D top-down arena shooter, you\u2019ll start each run by selecting your vessel and a primary weapon, which you manually aim with the mouse. As the ocean gets deadlier by the second, you\u2019ll gather upgrades, unlock new ship weapons that auto-fire at nearby threats, and build an u